        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cc-0ac6-76da-8210-650a115017db -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Worker skips the final batch when it has fewer than 20 jobs\n\nThe loop in `deliver_due` processes only full batches of 20, contradicting the documented guarantee that one invocation delivers all due jobs.\n\nThe worker leaves up to 19 due jobs pending and prints zero when fewer than 20 are due.\n\nUse `len(jobs)` as the range stop so the existing slice includes the final partial batch.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-37f8-7432-9e5c-e258dc9514e9/findings/01a202cc-0ac9-735f-ad54-434a9aaf737f)\n\nAlso at:\n- [`console.py`](https://github.com/Pratik8445/bench-run-coderabbit/blob/6cca1e909a083c5a7f3fefc60ba637c2c84c411c/console.py#L32-L35) lines 32 to 35",
